        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. The platform supports deposits for custom and special orders and layaway, with automatic balance tracking and customer notifications. Custom pieces such as wedding bands start as review orders, tracked from the client's request to collection.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q"><button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var i=this.closest('.faq-item');i.classList.toggle('open');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',i.classList.contains('open'))">
