          What's the best POS system for a pet store?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>It depends on your scale. For independent pet stores with heavy grooming and daycare scheduling, pet-specific platforms like Gingr, PetStack, or SuperPet Cloud are strong choices. For multi-location pet retail chains (10+ stores) that need enterprise inventory management, centralized fleet control, integrated omnichannel (BOPIS, ship-from-store, subscriptions), loyalty programs, and shopper-display POS advertising, Teamwork Commerce is the enterprise-grade option. Proven at scale with Petco Mexico's 127-store, 2,000+ terminal deployment.</p></div>
