          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The POS keeps every terminal selling through a network outage. Card data is encrypted at the point of capture and never stored on the POS; sales queue locally and sync to the back office when connectivity returns. During the halftime rush at a sold-out game, that keeps the line moving even when 50,000 fans saturate the network.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q"><button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var i=this.closest('.faq-item');i.classList.toggle('open');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',i.classList.contains('open'))">
