        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Teamwork Commerce specializes in merchandise retail, team jerseys, hats, memorabilia, and fan gear. For F&amp;B operations, Teamwork integrates with your existing concession POS or F&amp;B vendor via open APIs. Unifying food and merchandise is the long-term goal, and Teamwork's open architecture is built to support that integration.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q"><button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="var i=this.closest('.faq-item');i.classList.toggle('open');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',i.classList.contains('open'))">
